0..79 Comment "// A call written where a value is read runs, and a pure one whose value a type"
80..157 Comment "// after it reads stands there as what it returns: a dependent record\'s first"
158..231 Comment "// component under the second\'s type, and a dependent function\'s argument"
232..306 Comment "// under the parameters after it (#426). A parameter function under `cong`"
307..383 Comment "// answers at its own span (#443). The records are the HoTT book\'s dependent"
384..455 Comment "// pairs (§ 1.6), and the maps out of the circle follow cubical Agda\'s"
456..512 Comment "// `IsoFunSpaceS¹` (`Cubical/HITs/S1/Properties.agda`)."
514..545 Comment "// The circle and the integers."
